NC Digital designs custom websites for businesses in Abergavenny — hand-coded, mobile-first sites built to rank on Google and convert visitors into enquiries.

## Web design built for Abergavenny businesses

Abergavenny is a thriving Monmouthshire market town known as the gateway to the Brecon Beacons. With a strong hospitality, tourism, and professional services economy — as well as trades serving a wide rural catchment — a well-built website directly influences how many enquiries you receive.

We design from scratch, no templates. Every site is fast, mobile-friendly, and structured for SEO from the first page.

## What's included in every web design project

- Bespoke design based on your brand and goals
- Mobile-first, tested across all screen sizes and browsers
- On-page SEO — titles, meta descriptions, heading structure, schema markup
- Contact forms with spam protection
- Google Analytics and Search Console connected
- SSL certificate and security hardening included

